  "text": "About us\nProjects\nTeam\nCompetitions\nSponsor us\nJoin Marinor\nMARINOR NTNU · COMPETITIONS\nPick a competition.\n\nRead about Njord in Trondheim, where we sail Argus, or RoboBoat in Florida, where we want to go next.\n\n2\nCOMPETITIONS\n2\nCONTINENTS\n1\nBOAT: ARGUS\nWE COMPETE HERE\nNjord\n\nA student competition in Trondheim where autonomous boats solve tasks in the harbour without anyone steering.\n\nTRONDHEIM\nAUGUST\nNJORD NTNU\nExplore Njord\nNEXT GOAL\nRoboBoat\n\nA large competition for autonomous boats, held every February in Sarasota, Florida.\n\nSARASOTA, FL\nFEBRUARY\nROBONATION\nExplore RoboBoat\nSIDE BY SIDE\nTwo competitions, one kind of boat.\nNjord\nRoboBoat\nWHERE\nNyhavna, Trondheim\nSarasota, Florida\nWHEN\nFive days in August\nEvery February\nRUN BY\nNjord NTNU\nRoboNation\nMARINOR\nTook part in 2026\nOur goal after Njord\nTHE ROAD AHEAD\nWhere we compete.\n2026\nFirst time at Njord\n\nArgus sails the Njord Challenge in Trondheim with 22 other teams.\n\n2027\nWin Njord\n\nBack in Nyhavna, this time to win.\n\nThen\nRoboBoat\n\nEnter RoboBoat in Florida with what we learn at Njord.\n\nCOME ALONG\nFollow us to the start line.\n\nSee the boat we compete with, or support us as a partner.\n\nMeet Argus\nBecome a partner\n\nA student organisation at NTNU in Trondheim that builds autonomous boats.\n\nmarinorntnu@gmail.com\nCopy\nHøgskoleringen 1\n7034 Trondheim\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nMARINOR\nHome\nAbout us\nTeam\nCompetitions\nOUR WORK\nArgus\nProteus\nNjord Challenge\nRoboBoat\nGET INVOLVED\nJoin the crew\nSponsor us\nEmail us\n© 2026 Marinor NTNU\nOrg.nr. 936 064 809\nBack to top",
